# The first seeded, replayable Beyond Zork line anywhere, from the
# hilltop to the Coconut of Quendor. The map and the gauges live in
# the upper window, which the recording keeps. The hero is built by
# hand on the arrow-driven Character Setup screen -- the .accept
# <key> tokens pressing the same §3.8.4 codes a keyboard would -- to
# the walkthrough's recipe: 9 points into Intelligence (enough for
# the first scroll), the rest split evenly. Base attributes start
# at 1, so the gauges land on 18/18/18/10.

# Two enters page the intro; three downs walk the menu from
# "Begin using a preset character" to "Create your own character".
