# refreshes the lantern and dagger. The rat-ant scurries in as the
# scroll is taken.
d
get scroll
read scroll
squirp

# Each fight and each random map from here on is pinned to the seed
# that was tried and found to go well: the pin reseeds the stream
# where it stands, so the game keeps rolling ordinary dice, only
# the same ones every time. Seed 4 fells the rat-ant with one blow.
! SEED=4
attack rat-ant
wait

